    "cash_dividends": "Twelve issuer annual filings after the interval report never paying dividends, supporting a retrospective no-cash-dividend conclusion. This is not pre-decision publication evidence.",
    "future_transformations": "NOW December 2025 split and SQ January 2025 ticker change are used only to compare present vendor histories in historical units; neither is inserted into the 2021/January 2022 ledger.",
    "split_and_other_actions": "Secondary event lists are empty within the requested interval; twelve annual texts contain no stock-split or reverse-split phrase. These absence checks are not a complete action register, and no complete-through certificate is issued.",
    "sq_afterpay": "January 31, 2022 acquisition of Afterpay affects acquisition accounting/new shares; existing SQ holders are not Afterpay conversion recipients. No per-held-SQ-share receipt is inferred.",
    "sq_name_announcement": "December 1, 2021 issuer notice says SQ ticker and CUSIP would remain unchanged and existing holders need take no action. Do not create a sale, new position or SQ-to-XYZ event in 2021."
  },
